   126	
   127	`docs/revision/followup2/convergence_v2.py` (under `docs/`, code freeze). Before any episode: `TOUCHSTONE_LOCKED` refused,
   128	`experiments/locked.yaml` and the manifest equal protocol-v2; salt, commit, runner and `sim/` equal to protocol-v2;
   129	configuration hashes (fresh: recorded container hashes; headline: the registered record's); each job paired with its
